        "text_cHcfJR": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Fabrics we use:</strong></p><p>We only use premium quality imported fabrics procured from a few finest fabric manufacturing firms around the globe. Pure Cotton, Italian Cotton, Egyptian Cotton, Corduroy, Flannel, Dobby, Poplin, Oxford Cotton, Linen, and Cotton Linen are mostly used for shirts.</p>",
