        "text_RrBWUC": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>What makes us different?</strong></p><p>Our clients are our family. Once you have ordered a shirt, we will ensure that you are fully satisfied with your customized shirt as well as our services. Once your favourite shirt is crafted and you are satisfied with our services, you only need to call us whenever you are looking for new fabrics and our sales rep will be at your door to facilitate and we will take care of the rest.</p>",
